<title>JAPAN: Japan Paper Industry trade suspended - TSE.</title>
<headline>Japan Paper Industry trade suspended - TSE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange said on Friday it had suspended trade in Japan Paper Industries Co Ltd shares due to a lack of clarity stemming from media reports that the firm is planning a merger.</p>
</text>
